      "headline": "Lead DevOps Engineer | DevOps, Cloud & Automation Architect | GitLab CI/CD, AWS, VMware, Ansible, Python, FastAPI | MCA, M.Tech in AI/ML",
      "about": "Lead DevOps Engineer with over 13 years of IT experience, specializing in bridging the gap between complex development requirements and stable, scalable infrastructure. Currently, I drive DevOps initiatives at Medtronic, where I focus on automating release cycles, managing virtualization, and building custom tooling to support engineering teams.\n\nKey Areas of Expertise:\n\nCI/CD Orchestration: Architecting pipelines using GitLab CI/CD and Jenkins to automate builds and deployments.\n\nInfrastructure & Virtualization: Managing hybrid environments across AWS (EC2, S3, Lambda), VMware, Docker, and Kubernetes.\n\nBuild Engineering: Expert in packaging and installation automation using InstallShield and Shell Scripting.\n\nConfiguration Management: Automating state management with Ansible and Terraform.\n\nDevSecOps & Coding: Writing production-grade automation scripts in Python and building internal UI tools with ReactJS.\n\nTech Stack: AWS | VMware | GitLab | Jenkins | Docker | Kubernetes | Ansible | Terraform | Python | ReactJS | FastAPI | C# .NET | Selenium\n\nI thrive in Agile environments where I can lead teams, mentor junior engineers, and drive technical innovation.",
